    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "The reader's hair stands on end when he reads in the final pages of the novel that the heroine, a dear old lady who had always been so kind to everybody, had, in her youth, poisoned every one of her five husbands.",
      "translation": "当读者在小说的最后几页读到女主人公——一位总是对每个人都很和蔼的可亲老妇人——在年轻时毒死了她的5个丈夫中的每一个时，他会感到毛骨悚然。",
      "startTime": 43.08,
